{
    "title": "Macy's: Online Shopping & Save",
    "description": "Discover Black Friday\u2019s Best Deals and Thanksgiving offers\u2014with Macy\u2019s App! Designed to bring your online shopping experience to life, explore a wide selection of top brands and shop must-have fashion items in jewelry, shoes, accessories, handbags, and more. \r\n\r\nWhether you're treating yourself, buying holiday gifts for loved ones, or finding the perfect pieces to refresh your home the Macy\u2019s app makes it easy, effortless, and fun! Plus, you can conveniently place an order for delivery or returns directly from the app. \r\n\r\nNot to mention, you\u2019ll be able to access your Star Rewards account for special offers and exclusive app savings. \r\n\r\nExplore Six Features of the Macy's App: \r\n- Access your Personal Stylist: Keep up with the latest trends and access curated fashion tips for a stylish wardrobe and on-trend items. \r\n- Save your Faves: Easily save all your favorite clothes, accessories and more, in one easily accessible place. \r\n- Get Exclusive Deals: Dive into exclusive deals on everything from items like jewelry, swimwear, to home items. Enjoy special discounts when you order through the app. \r\n- Effortless Rewards Management: Seamlessly manage your Star Rewards, making every shop and order more rewarding. \r\n- Quick Checkout: Speed through payments in store with the convenient Macy\u2019s Pay feature, making it easy to complete your order and handle returns. \r\n- Enhanced Shopping Experience: Use Store Mode to navigate and shop at Macy\u2019s stores & Price Check to enhance your in-store shopping, making your delivery and returns process smoother. \r\n\r\nSTAY ON-TREND WITH MACY\u2019S ONLINE SHOPPING \r\nStay in the know with notifications on fashion trends, new clothes collections, accessories, and exclusive app discounts, delivered straight to your home screen. Shop smarter with Macy\u2019s, whether you're placing an order for delivery or checking returns policies. \r\n\r\nLISTS & FASHION TIPS \r\nCollect your favorite fashion styles with absolute ease. Just tap \u201cAdd to List\u201d and plan your outfits and fashion items for the season ahead. \r\nReceive alerts for price drops on your saved clothes and accessories. \r\nShare style boards with friends for fashion feedback and help them decide on their next order. Place an order easily and keep track of your delivery status for all your items directly through the app. \r\nTake our Style Inspo quiz to discover new fashion looks and shop for your new clothes and accessories effortlessly. \r\n\r\nEXPLORE PERSONALIZED UPDATES \r\nInstantly access your current orders and rewards balance as soon as you open the app. \r\nStay updated on your delivery status and returns. \r\nStay informed about your points and track when your rewards expire. \r\nEasily locate your personalized order barcode and store pickup details for a seamless shopping and return experience. \r\n\r\nMANAGE YOUR STAR REWARDS EFFORTLESSLY \r\nEasily monitor your Macy\u2019s Card account balance. \r\nConveniently schedule and make payments directly from the app. \r\nKeep track of your progress toward the next loyalty status and enjoy more rewards with every order! \r\n\r\nCHECK OUT IN A FLASH WITH WALLET \r\nAccess all your Macy\u2019s offers conveniently in one place, ready for use when you shop online or in-store for your favorite fashion items, making returns just as easy as placing an order. \r\nExperience quicker checkouts with the best offer applied every time for your favorite fashion clothes and accessories. \r\nSecurely manage your payment information in one spot for peace of mind when it comes to your favorite clothes. \r\n\r\nNAVIGATE WITH STORE MODE \r\nScan barcodes to check prices, read reviews, and shop for additional colors, sizes, and other fashion items\u2013 you can even order online for home delivery! \r\nUtilize Macy\u2019s maps to let us know what you\u2019re searching for, and we\u2019ll guide you straight to it, making sure your order and returns are as smooth as possible.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover Black Friday\u2019s Best Deals and Thanksgiving offers\u2014with Macy\u2019s App! Designed to bring your online shopping experience to life, explore a wide selection of top brands and shop must-have fashion items in jewelry, shoes, accessories, handbags, and more. <br><br>Whether you&#39;re treating yourself, buying holiday gifts for loved ones, or finding the perfect pieces to refresh your home the Macy\u2019s app makes it easy, effortless, and fun! Plus, you can conveniently place an order for delivery or returns directly from the app. <br><br>Not to mention, you\u2019ll be able to access your Star Rewards account for special offers and exclusive app savings. <br><br>Explore Six Features of the Macy&#39;s App: <br>- Access your Personal Stylist: Keep up with the latest trends and access curated fashion tips for a stylish wardrobe and on-trend items. <br>- Save your Faves: Easily save all your favorite clothes, accessories and more, in one easily accessible place. <br>- Get Exclusive Deals: Dive into exclusive deals on everything from items like jewelry, swimwear, to home items. Enjoy special discounts when you order through the app. <br>- Effortless Rewards Management: Seamlessly manage your Star Rewards, making every shop and order more rewarding. <br>- Quick Checkout: Speed through payments in store with the convenient Macy\u2019s Pay feature, making it easy to complete your order and handle returns. <br>- Enhanced Shopping Experience: Use Store Mode to navigate and shop at Macy\u2019s stores &amp; Price Check to enhance your in-store shopping, making your delivery and returns process smoother. <br><br>STAY ON-TREND WITH MACY\u2019S ONLINE SHOPPING <br>Stay in the know with notifications on fashion trends, new clothes collections, accessories, and exclusive app discounts, delivered straight to your home screen. Shop smarter with Macy\u2019s, whether you&#39;re placing an order for delivery or checking returns policies. <br><br>LISTS &amp; FASHION TIPS <br>Collect your favorite fashion styles with absolute ease. Just tap \u201cAdd to List\u201d and plan your outfits and fashion items for the season ahead. <br>Receive alerts for price drops on your saved clothes and accessories. <br>Share style boards with friends for fashion feedback and help them decide on their next order. Place an order easily and keep track of your delivery status for all your items directly through the app. <br>Take our Style Inspo quiz to discover new fashion looks and shop for your new clothes and accessories effortlessly. <br><br>EXPLORE PERSONALIZED UPDATES <br>Instantly access your current orders and rewards balance as soon as you open the app. <br>Stay updated on your delivery status and returns. <br>Stay informed about your points and track when your rewards expire. <br>Easily locate your personalized order barcode and store pickup details for a seamless shopping and return experience. <br><br>MANAGE YOUR STAR REWARDS EFFORTLESSLY <br>Easily monitor your Macy\u2019s Card account balance. <br>Conveniently schedule and make payments directly from the app. <br>Keep track of your progress toward the next loyalty status and enjoy more rewards with every order! <br><br>CHECK OUT IN A FLASH WITH WALLET <br>Access all your Macy\u2019s offers conveniently in one place, ready for use when you shop online or in-store for your favorite fashion items, making returns just as easy as placing an order. <br>Experience quicker checkouts with the best offer applied every time for your favorite fashion clothes and accessories. <br>Securely manage your payment information in one spot for peace of mind when it comes to your favorite clothes. <br><br>NAVIGATE WITH STORE MODE <br>Scan barcodes to check prices, read reviews, and shop for additional colors, sizes, and other fashion items\u2013 you can even order online for home delivery! <br>Utilize Macy\u2019s maps to let us know what you\u2019re searching for, and we\u2019ll guide you straight to it, making sure your order and returns are as smooth as possible.",
